Attribution / Credit
--------------------
This circuit is based in part on, and adapted from, work by
cherry-takuan (ちぇりーたくあん):

  - Source : https://github.com/cherry-takuan/nlp
             (referenced portion: nlp-16a/Hardware/debug)
  - License: CC BY-SA 4.0

Changes were made. Portions reused are limited to functional/standard
practice (power-supply decoupling placement near the VDD/VSS pins, and
the WCH-Link programming-header arrangement and its comments). In keeping
with the ShareAlike spirit of the original, this 7segIF hardware is also
released under CC BY-SA 4.0.


